    description: "Found by the 2026-11-07 docstring staleness audit (dev 4f2feb451b): a reviewer flagged it and a default-REJECT verifier re-reproduced it on a fixture of its own (reports under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/staleness_audit_11072026/review, verify and blind). Corpus impact not measured. The play's keys are all processed before its nested items are visited, so in_handlers is already True when the tasks are walked (yaml_ansible.py:365-370, 395-396, 429-445). A play with Install nginx under tasks: and restart nginx under handlers: gives both as handler. b01; re-run by the orchestrator on its own fixture."  # f018
